  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KOz7JEb.png\" alt=\"升级核心\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"仅支持 Forge\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\">\n</p>\n请通过 Modrinth 下载，请勿重新托管文件。\n\n本模组可用于任何整合包。（仅限 Modrinth）\n\n\n目前暂无 Fabric 版本的计划，抱歉。\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\">\n</p>\n <u><b>模组说明</b></u><br><br><br>\n\n本模组包含我其他模组的共享代码。\n\n该模组本身并不会产生任何效果。 \n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\">\n</p>\n<table border=\"0\">\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite\" title=\"升级下界合金\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/7seKMZeT/62d61f2a09ab2b71272ddf9b8ac0e941a2152399.png\" title=\"升级下界合金\" width=\"64\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite\"><b>升级下界合金</b></a><br>添加了具有实用效果的升级版下界合金。</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite-items\" title=\"升级下界合金：物品\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/x2OcOwHz/a390efeb5adc0ab6c2bf8738432d87f118073fa8.png\" title=\"升级下界合金：物品\" width=\"64\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite-items\"><b>升级下界合金：物品</b></a><br>为升级下界合金模组添加了一些物品，例如苹果和图腾。</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/bcGOQ7CG/d0b6620ed4ad68af5639651cbe1e53f42e6fb10f.png\" title=\"升级下界合金：Ultimerite\" width=\"64\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\"><b>升级下界合金：Ultimerite</b></a><br>为升级下界合金模组添加了 Ultimerite 阶位。</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-tools\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/g5wnyyqe/0107b4718248527938f12e19b1b0d06ab49d68db.png\" title=\"升级工具\" width=\"64\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/upgraded-tools\"><b>升级工具</b></a><br>添加了兼具剑、斧、镐、铲和锄功能的锤子。</td></tr>\n</table>\n</center>",
